
> propiq-api@0.1.0 sandbox
> tsx sandbox/sandbox.ts


PropIQ sandbox is running (in-memory; everything resets when you stop it)

  API            http://localhost:4400
  Sign-in        http://localhost:54369   (stand-in for Supabase Auth)
  Sign in as     owner@bytecraft.local  /  sandbox-pass   (Owner of ByteCraft)

Start the website against it (a second terminal, from the project root):

  NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:54369 NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sandbox NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4400 npm run dev

Press Ctrl+C to stop.

